    "regime_notes": "Passed benchmark-wide absolute IC and ICIR gates with materially lower turnover than the 10-day/60-day recovery variant. Positive annual IC in 2020-2022 and 2025-2026, but negative in 2023-2024; the small 15-asset cross-section requires conservative interpretation."
